      "doc": "A Bootstrap date picker (an `.input-group` of a `.form-control` and a button; Fluent UI Blazor's FluentDatePicker,\nMudBlazor's MudDatePicker; InputBase — bind it\nwith @bind-value): a text field for the date as the locale writes it (\"10/10/2026\", \"10.10.2026\"; ISO works too)\nand a button that opens a Calendar in a dialog. The value is an ISO date (\"2026-10-10\"), which no time zone\nshifts. The calendar opens on the value (or today) with its keys; a picked day or Escape closes it and the focus\ngoes back. Alt+ArrowDown in the field opens it too. `view` months or years picks a month or a year. Text that is no\ndate goes to validation as it was typed (as with a NumberInput). Validation state and message as with TextInput —\nthe same parameters as the Fluent skin's DatePicker.",
